Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.31,0:21:42.24,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.49,0:21:43.93,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}好想被愛
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.93,0:21:50.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.81,0:21:54.03,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.03,0:21:56.84,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.84,0:21:59.81,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.81,0:22:02.09,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.22,0:22:05.30,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.30,0:22:07.85,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.85,0:22:10.74,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.74,0:22:13.23,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.23,0:22:16.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.36,0:22:20.40,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.56,0:22:26.66,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}留在過去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.20,0:22:33.01,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.33,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.47,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.47,0:22:44.43,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.55,0:22:48.55,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.25,0:22:51.60,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.52,0:23:02.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.31,0:21:42.24,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.49,0:21:43.93,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.93,0:21:50.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.81,0:21:54.03,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.03,0:21:56.84,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.84,0:21:59.81,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.81,0:22:02.09,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.22,0:22:05.30,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.30,0:22:07.85,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.85,0:22:10.74,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.74,0:22:13.23,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.23,0:22:16.36,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.36,0:22:20.40,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.56,0:22:26.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.20,0:22:33.01,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.33,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.47,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.47,0:22:44.43,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.55,0:22:48.55,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.25,0:22:51.60,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.52,0:23:02.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:42.24,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:43.93,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}好想被愛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.93,0:21:50.34,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
